[00:14.98]1. Raise your eyes up and see,
[00:19.64]Far above the highest hill.
[00:23.20]There stands Jehovah’s mountain
[00:27.56]Lifted up in this day.
[00:31.84]People come from afar,
[00:37.56]Ev’rywhere from sea to sea,
[00:41.10]Calling to one another,
[00:45.74]‘Come serve God and obey.’
[00:49.69]Now the time has arrived
[00:53.36]For the small, a great nation to be.
[00:58.52]As we grow and we thrive,
[01:03.54]God’s direction and blessing we see.
[01:08.44]Millions now come to God
[01:12.78]And accept his sov’reignty.
[01:17.58]Loyal they vow to be
[01:21.74]And from his side never stray.
[01:46.99]2. Jesus gave the command
[01:49.77]To go forth and preach the word.
[01:54.93]Good news about the Kingdom
[01:59.59]Reaches all men today.
[02:03.81]Christ now rules from above,
[02:09.19]Urging all to take his side.
[02:13.87]Meek ones who hear his voice
[02:17.91]Let God’s Word show them the way.
[02:22.51]It brings joy to the heart,
[02:26.93]As the great crowd continues to grow.
[02:31.66]And we all have a part,
[02:36.38]As we strive to let ev’ryone know.
[02:41.59]Let us lift up the voice,
[02:47.33]Calling out for all to hear,
[02:51.09]‘Come to Jehovah’s mountain,
[02:56.09]Here forever to stay.’
